# Keep text LF in the repository; Windows-native script types carry CRLF.
#
# The .ps1 / .cmd / .bat entries matter more than usual here: this project ships a
# builder whose self-check counts non-ASCII bytes in exactly those file types, and a
# checkout that silently rewrote their line endings would make its own tests lie
# about the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
